Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.07,0:00:05.28,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,All right then, \N we’re headed off to the market.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.28,0:00:08.70,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,We should grab some berries \N and mushrooms in the forest, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.28,0:00:13.12,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Whoa! \N They’ve got some rare vegetables!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.16,0:00:16.54,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,We should go Pokémon Battling!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.62,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.67,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Then, I’ll...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Liko!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.01,0:00:27.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Come here with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.63,0:00:28.59,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.59,0:00:32.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It says this café’s doing \N a Metamon collab menu!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.47,0:00:36.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Squishy Meta-Mochi Parfaits! \N Shall we?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.44,0:00:40.40,Main,Liko Navi,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.81,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.82,Main,Liko Navi,0,0,0,,Time to dig in!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.61,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Mmmm!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.61,0:00:51.66,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Squishy-squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.47,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,You two seem to have \N some nice squishies.{Yakata: Hard-sounding name, hard-looking katakana, stiff appearance, stiff-sounding dialog, stiff movements, loves soft. Secretly mixes in phone game jargon in his dialog in ways you need to know the phone jargon to get.}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.22,0:01:13.22,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ah, I am no shady individual.{Fred line}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.18,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You look pretty shady to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.89,0:01:20.89,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,In what way?{mirrored later}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.89,0:01:22.52,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,But that aside...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.52,0:01:24.11,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Those squishy-squishies...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.98,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,May I have the honor of \N squish-squishing them?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.98,0:01:28.32,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.32,0:01:30.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sure, totally fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.15,0:01:31.20,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.61,0:01:33.03,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Right, Metamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.57,0:01:37.66,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ooh! Your generosity is \N greatly appreciated!{very formal set phrase, I am 'thankfully' happy / happy in my gratitude}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.29,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Then, for the touch test.{jisshoku - 'actual tasting' - tasting a food for real, but he turns it into 'actual touch'}{gets repeated later}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.08,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ooooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.21,0:01:53.13,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,This is the highest class of squishiness, \N attainable only by Squipokés beloved by their trainers!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.05,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,And now for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.22,0:01:58.56,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Do excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.43,0:02:01.14,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I won’t overstep boundaries.{I would never force you. / I won't ask the unreasonable.}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.14,0:02:03.73,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,But please, \N allow me to ask you this.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.73,0:02:04.56,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Are you two...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.06,0:02:07.82,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,...at all interested in Squipokacts?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.82,0:02:08.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.32,0:02:09.94,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What?
Comment: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:09.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:40.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.04,0:03:54.92,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I see this Meta-Mochi’s fame \N was well-earned, after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.64,0:04:01.05,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Mmmm!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.44,0:04:08.52,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Mmmm!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.19,0:04:12.27,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Another good squish today. \N My Squipokacts are progressing well.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.94,0:04:16.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Um... So, what’s this “Squipokacts” thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.53,0:04:19.66,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ah, of course. \N Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.66,0:04:23.24,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,“Squipokacts” refers to doing \N squishy Pokémon-admiring activities.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.24,0:04:25.16,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,It’s short for “Squipoké Activities.”
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.66,0:04:32.96,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,{\q2}During my days as a salaryman in Hiun City, \N when I was feeling crushed beneath my myriad stresses...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.54,0:04:37.17,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,...I found squishy Pokémon in my time of need! \N And Squipokacts, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.72,0:04:38.30,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.30,0:04:42.64,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Squipokacts give me \N the energy to live on!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.81,0:04:47.77,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So basically you love squishies, \N right, old man Yakata?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.77,0:04:53.31,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Yes. After reflecting on my desire \N for squishies to be as close to me as possible,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.32,0:04:56.23,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I opted for this spec.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.03,0:04:58.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.74,0:05:00.57,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? You know what he’s getting at?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.57,0:05:03.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Nah, not even a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.32,0:05:05.54,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,But just look at ‘em all and see...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.95,0:05:08.62,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They look... pretty happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.58,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.50,0:05:13.71,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,But aren’t they \N kind of squeezing you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.71,0:05:14.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Are you okay in there?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.34,0:05:19.26,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,More than okay! \N This pressure is the greatest bliss!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.26,0:05:22.93,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,To a Squisher, \N this can only be seen as a reward!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.93,0:05:24.72,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Bliss...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.89,0:05:28.81,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.81,0:05:32.31,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Do you understand \N what I’m feeling?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.15,0:05:35.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Umm... Probably!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.77,0:05:42.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Maybe it’s like when I’m petting Masquernya \N and I think “I’m so happy.”
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.53,0:05:45.20,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Pre! Cise! Ly! Cor! Rect!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.95,0:05:54.67,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ooh! Miracle collab squishy, \N welcome and hello there!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.67,0:05:58.67,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Mm-hm, squishy, aren’t we? \N Mm-hm...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.17,0:06:01.05,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.22,0:06:03.26,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.30,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I lost track of myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.30,0:06:08.60,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,To get back to business, \N would you be at all interested in Squipokacts—
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I am!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.10,0:06:10.06,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.06,0:06:13.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Liko, let’s do it! \N Squipokacts with the old man!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.69,0:06:17.86,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Hmm... Right! \N We’ve still got free time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.90,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I’m glad to hear it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.90,0:06:22.45,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,The truth is, I’m in this city...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.45,0:06:26.32,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,...because my Squipokacts friends \N informed me...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.32,0:06:29.66,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,...that it’s home to spots where \N many rare squishy Pokémon appear!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.66,0:06:31.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’ve got friends...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.50,0:06:33.04,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,So then...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.58,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Let’s squishy-squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.58,0:06:37.75,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Squishy-squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.13,0:06:45.64,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,The first rare squishy Pokémon is... \N Goronya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.09,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Goronya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.09,0:06:49.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I don’t think that’s squishy at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.39,0:06:54.10,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I thought so too, \N but one squish is worth a thousand words!{lit: A hundred hearings don't make a single seeing->squish!, EN idiom seems close enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.10,0:06:56.98,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Immediately after \N their yearly shedding,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.98,0:06:59.98,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Goronya are apparently \N exquisitely squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.98,0:07:03.11,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,But don’t they harden{same word as the move} back up \N immediately after shedding...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.11,0:07:07.28,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Indeed! So the chances for \N a Goronya-squishing are exceedingly slim!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.12,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I must not allow that chance \N to slip away!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.12,0:07:13.62,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Then we’ll have to go \N to where Goronya shed.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.62,0:07:15.16,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.16,0:07:18.67,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,And through evaluating past data, \N weather patterns, and so on and so forth,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.67,0:07:23.80,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,{\q2}I have already confirmed that today’s \N Goronya-shedding index is nearly one hundred percent.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing! You’re kinda smart!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.56,0:07:38.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s a Goronya—!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.81,0:07:39.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There was one!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.25,0:07:55.00,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.25,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.25,0:08:00.21,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s sheddi—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.13,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.88,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,A squish chance arrives!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.55,0:08:07.88,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Not good! It spotted us!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.10,0:08:16.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.98,0:08:19.27,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,M... My rare squish...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.15,0:08:26.03,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Are you trying to console me?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.32,0:08:34.49,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ahh... That calms me down...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.49,0:08:37.12,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.00,0:08:41.88,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,It was my fault \N we missed the squish chance,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.54,0:08:43.71,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,and for that I am dearly sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.51,0:08:53.80,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.97,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,An apologem for Goronya.{apology stone, phone game term for giving gems(stones) as apologies for issues... But this time it's an actual stone.}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.97,0:08:58.77,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,As they say, \N “beloved squishies call for good manners.”{attempting 'keep good manners between good neighbors' but the idiom's been mangled enough it's hard to get anyway. Dictionary site EN equivocations give 'good fences make good neighbors' but the manners are needed here...}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.44,0:09:01.98,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I don’t know \N if I’ll ever return here...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.65,0:09:05.02,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,But I’m sorry for the disturbance.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.69,0:09:10.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I kinda thought he was just a weirdo grown-up, \N but he’s actually polite.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.15,0:09:13.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,He really does adore squishy Pokémon, \N doesn’t he?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.53,0:09:18.45,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah! But Navi wanted \N to squish a Goronya...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.12,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Actually, so did I...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.51,0:09:31.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa-haha! It’s all squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.68,0:09:33.68,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ooh? Can I try?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.43,0:09:36.85,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’re right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.14,0:09:41.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.31,0:09:45.98,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You want to let me squish you too, \N Masquernya?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.86,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It’s so squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.45,0:09:55.95,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,The next rare squishy Pokémon is... \N Shellder.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.95,0:09:58.41,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wait, aren’t Shellder hard, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.41,0:10:01.33,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,“A wise Squipoké hides its squish!”{A skilled eagle hides its talons!}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.08,0:10:06.09,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I hear Shellder’s innards \N are incredibly squishy!
Comment: 10,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.55,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.72,0:10:17.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.85,0:10:21.35,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There’s a Shellder here!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.10,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.36,0:10:28.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Looks like we made it mad.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.44,0:10:31.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Does this mean a battle, \N and no way to stop it?{Could this mean a battle with no possibility of calling timeouts beforehand?}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.70,0:10:33.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.95,0:10:35.07,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Stop it!{Timeout!}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.07,0:10:35.74,Main,Liko Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.74,0:10:40.62,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,A Squisher must never squrden \N a Squipoké by their Squipokacts!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.62,0:10:42.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s a squrden?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.96,0:10:46.13,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,There were so many sibilants \N that I didn’t get any of that!{In Japanese, Liko mentions plosives, but because all those sounds become sibilants in English, we had to adjust the line accordingly.}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.13,0:10:47.54,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,It means “burden.”
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.54,0:10:53.88,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,{\q2}In any case! We must not anger or frighten \N the applicable Pokémon for our mere squish wish!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.88,0:10:58.68,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,This is a strict rule \N that a Squisher must never break!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.93,0:11:01.81,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You have rules, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.52,0:11:04.52,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Are you interested?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.19,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Then let me give you \N these Squisher-Rules Karuta.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.94,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.40,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,“Squisher-Rules Karuta”?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.78,0:11:14.82,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Original karuta manufactured \N at my own expense.{as in 'I paid to have made' through salaryman-coded 'expenses' }
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.82,0:11:20.37,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,{\q2}In total, they depict one hundred and eight Squisher Rules, \N so you can learn them as you play...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.91,0:11:21.83,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.83,0:11:22.79,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.75,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Shellder’s gone!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.75,0:11:27.63,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,What the—?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.63,0:11:30.29,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We missed a squish again, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.29,0:11:32.55,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I have twice done \N something unforgivable.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.55,0:11:34.72,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,This is hardly enough \N for a full apology, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.72,0:11:37.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? We get apologems?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.01,0:11:39.14,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Have a go at Namakobushi tossing.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.51,0:11:44.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Namakobushi tossing?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.52,0:11:47.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Oh, I’ve heard of that!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.52,0:11:51.11,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I think... it’s a part-time job \N they do in the Alola Region, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.11,0:11:54.82,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It’s the act of returning \N washed-up Namakobushi to the sea.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.82,0:11:57.99,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That sounds crazy fun! \N I’ll do it, I’ll do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.91,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,You mustn’t merely toss it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.91,0:12:03.33,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,You must toss it {\i1}while{\i} feeling \N Namakobushi’s squishiness!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.33,0:12:04.54,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.75,0:12:10.79,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wow! It’s all squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.79,0:12:13.17,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,That’s not enough. \N Squish it more!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.17,0:12:14.55,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.55,0:12:15.30,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.63,0:12:17.68,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,More, I say!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.68,0:12:18.97,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.80,0:12:23.06,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.06,0:12:26.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,O... kay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.69,0:12:30.44,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Th-That was fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.90,0:12:33.94,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,We Squishers are not the only ones \N to find it fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.94,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Even the tossed Namakobushi...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.57,0:12:43.08,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,...find it fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.83,0:12:45.33,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Plus, the other squishies.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.70,0:12:49.33,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? Can I do Yukihami \N and Bachin'uni tossing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.92,0:12:59.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wow! Lemme try \N a Metamon-Namakobushi toss too!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.93,0:13:03.18,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,She’s getting so excited over it...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.89,0:13:07.81,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We didn’t get to squish a Shellder, \N but that sure was fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.81,0:13:09.56,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I’m glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.02,0:13:13.31,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So what’s the next \N rare squishy Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.07,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,It’s Pendrar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.07,0:13:16.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Pendrar!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.86,0:13:19.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wait, that’s a Squipoké?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.07,0:13:24.33,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Yes! The belly of a wild Pendrar \N is exquisitely squishy-squishy... so I hear.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.74,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.74,0:13:30.25,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The Index doesn’t mention \N anything like that, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.25,0:13:31.50,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.50,0:13:36.38,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,But my exsquishience and insquishition \N as a Squisher are shouting it at me!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.38,0:13:40.30,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I see, your experience and intuition \N as a Squisher are shouting it at you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.30,0:13:42.55,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m surprised you got that, Liko.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.55,0:13:44.09,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Oh, so I did!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.68,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’m starting to scare myself...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.35,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pendrar!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.86,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Just look at that belly!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.86,0:13:58.36,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Doesn’t it look squishable?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.32,0:14:02.36,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,That’s quite the foolish remark \N he’s making about you.{Lalamoo: Soft-sounding name, soft-looking hiragana, cutesy look, fluid movements, cute soft speech full of downplaying, loves hardness}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.36,0:14:03.49,Main,Liko Yakata,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.49,0:14:04.37,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Who’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.74,0:14:07.87,Main,Roy Ult,0,0,0,,Liko?! Navi?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.37,Main,Liko Navi,0,0,0,,Roy?! Ult?!
Comment: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:18.46,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.47,0:14:27.43,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,You’re acquainted?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.43,0:14:28.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yes, we’re friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.89,0:14:32.56,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Oh, but I’ve never met that woman before.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.56,0:14:35.06,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. \N I’m Lalamoo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.06,0:14:37.69,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Nothing but a simple Hardman.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.69,0:14:38.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hardman?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.69,0:14:40.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.07,0:14:47.07,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh, a Hardman is a trainer who loves \N hard Pokémon, or “Harpokés” for short.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.07,0:14:53.29,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\q2}By the way, harnessing your hard fist to dehardmine \N whether a Harpoké’s hard is hard enough is called Harding!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.29,0:14:57.04,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Plus, Hardmen have all sorts of rules!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.04,0:15:02.76,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\q2}“A true Hardman’s Harpokacts must never leave \N a Harpoké with {\i1}hard{\i} feelings,” and so on, and so forth!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.76,0:15:05.05,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Now where have I heard {\i1}that{\i0} before?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.05,0:15:07.34,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I see. I get it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.34,0:15:13.85,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\q2}Ms. Lalamoo{Honorifics note: Lalamoo-san} has the opposite love to \N old man Yakata’s love of squishies! She loves hard stuff!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.98,0:15:16.31,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,You’re so right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.31,0:15:21.44,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,And as I was enjoying my Harpokacts, \N I happened upon dear Roy{Honorifics note: Roy-chan} and dear Ult{Honorifics note: Ult-chan}...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.99,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,...and invited the pair of them to go \N dear-Pendrar{Honorifs note: Pendrar-chan}-seeking with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.99,0:15:28.57,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,She was even really complimenting \N Ult’s rock collection!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.20,0:15:34.58,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Dear Ult{Honorifics note: Ult-chan} and dear Yamirami{Honorifics note: Yamirami-chan}’s stones \N were just so splendidly hard!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.04,0:15:38.71,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yer darn right! \N You really get me, Lalamoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.71,0:15:43.38,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Apparently the back of Loudbone’s jaw \N is exquisitely hard, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.38,0:15:50.47,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,And also, Cap’s presence alone is so hard and cool, \N she says he’s the bearer of an exquisite harrit!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.77,0:15:57.27,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh, “harrit” means spirit.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.27,0:16:02.86,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ahem! You spoke of “Pendrar-seeking” earlier, \N but {\i1}why{\i0} are you seeking Pendrar?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.86,0:16:07.86,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Why, naturally, \N because Pendrar’s belly is {\i1}rock-hard!{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.53,0:16:12.62,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,My, what a foolish remark you’ve made.{mirroring earlier}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.24,0:16:16.21,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Oh? In what way exactly?{mirroring earlier}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.21,0:16:19.67,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,In saying Pendrar’s belly was hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.67,0:16:22.75,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,But dear Pendrar’s{Honorifics note: Pendrar-chan’s} belly {\i1}is{\i0} hard, no?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.75,0:16:25.17,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Pendrar’s stomach is squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.17,0:16:26.13,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Oh, it’s quite hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.13,0:16:27.47,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,No, it’s squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.47,0:16:28.22,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,It’s hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.22,0:16:29.05,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.05,0:16:29.89,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Hard!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.39,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I told you, it’s {\i1}squishy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.39,0:16:34.89,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Didn’t I tell you it’s {\i1}hard?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.40,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wait, does that mean...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.40,0:16:42.90,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.61,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Whether Pendrar’s belly is squishy...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.61,0:16:47.65,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,...or hard...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.65,0:16:48.78,Main,Yakata Lalamoo,0,0,0,,...shall be decided by battle!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.78,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It’s battle time!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.41,0:16:54.58,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Right this way, Haganail!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.25,0:16:59.41,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Tesseed! Jiodzumu!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.25,0:17:02.88,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Whoa! They all look so hard!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.54,0:17:05.88,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,They’re mega-cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.88,0:17:10.01,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Namakobushi! \N Yukihami! Bachin'uni!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.39,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They look really soft!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.39,0:17:16.14,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They’re all squishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.06,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Now, let’s hartle!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.06,0:17:19.31,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,“Hartle”?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.31,0:17:23.52,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That’s {\i1}probably{\i} an abbreviation of \N “let’s have a hard Pokémon Battle”!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.52,0:17:26.28,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,We’ll show you our squond!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.57,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,“Squond”?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.57,0:17:29.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I think that’s “bond.”
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.03,0:17:30.78,Main,Yakata Lalamoo,0,0,0,,En garde!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.78,0:17:33.12,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Dear Haganail{Honorifics note: Haganail-chan}! Heavy Bomber!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.99,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Dear Tesseed{Honorifics note: Tesseed-chan}! Iron Head!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.99,0:17:38.20,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,And dear Jiodzumu{Honorifics note: Jiodzumu-chan}, use Body Press!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.21,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,All moves that sound hard!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.21,0:17:44.96,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.21,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Namakobushi! Helping Hand!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.89,0:17:57.06,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It’s using Helping Hand weird!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.07,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,How do you like that squishiness?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.07,0:18:13.41,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,It truly proves that \N “foresquished is forearmed”!{[The idiom] 'If you have prepared=>squished, you will suffer no trouble' was this very situation!}{EN attempt based on 'forewarned is forearmed' - seemed to fit well enough, doing something previously causing better results}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.41,0:18:16.41,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Enough of your foolishness! \N Once more!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.33,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Helping Hand!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.51,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa, it happened again!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.51,0:18:37.14,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They’re bouncing off the softness!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.47,0:18:39.89,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,You’re not half bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.89,0:18:43.89,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I have a question! \N Why do you always use the same moves?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.35,0:18:47.02,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,My oh my, \N that’s quite the foolish question.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.02,0:18:49.19,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,I’ve but one reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.19,0:18:53.53,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Only the hardest of moves \N can make a Hardman’s harrit quake!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.90,0:18:54.91,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.91,0:18:59.37,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,I suspect the reason you insist on \N only using Helping Hand is also...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.37,0:19:04.04,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Yes! A battle without squish \N would be a sandwich without filling!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.04,0:19:05.71,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,For it would be {\i1}nothing{\i0} to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.42,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.42,0:19:09.25,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Then we shall show you...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.25,0:19:11.67,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,...the move Hardmen \N can’t get enough of!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.30,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Harden!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.84,0:19:21.93,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Then, we too shall deliver \N another display of our squishy love!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.93,0:19:23.77,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Use Helping Hand!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.35,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.35,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,{\an8}My!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.35,0:19:28.69,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Today’s top squish has arrived!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.69,0:19:31.65,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,That’s your finest hardness! \N Your finest hardness!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.03,0:19:33.78,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.78,0:19:37.07,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys... \N What’re you doing out here?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.20,0:19:43.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They’re having a Pokémon Battle \N to decide if Pendrar’s belly is squishy or hard!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.25,0:19:44.62,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.54,0:19:50.00,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,I suspect that \N our difference in opinion...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.46,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,...is not something \N further battling can resolve.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.46,0:19:56.76,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Indeed. \N The best resolution in this case...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.76,0:20:00.43,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,...is to try touching \N dear Pendrar{Honorifics note: Pendrar-chan}’s belly for reals!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.76,0:20:02.81,Main,Yakata Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Touch test!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.31,0:20:06.27,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.27,0:20:07.10,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,It’s not here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.64,0:20:13.11,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We never did find out if Pendrar’s belly \N was squishy or hard, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.11,0:20:18.03,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Yes. But I’ve just decided \N on my goal for my next day off!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.03,0:20:22.87,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Right. Next time, \N I {\i1}will{\i0} get to touch dear Pendrar{Honorifics note: Pendrar-chan}’s belly!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.24,0:20:25.12,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,If you wouldn’t mind...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.70,0:20:28.50,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,How about we arrange \N to take the same day off?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.00,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.01,0:20:38.76,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?! They’re getting along!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.76,0:20:40.93,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,With you as witness...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.85,0:20:44.76,Main,Yakata,0,0,0,,I must prove \N that Pendrar is a Squipoké.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.60,0:20:48.02,Main,Lalamoo,0,0,0,,Dear Pendrar{Honorifics note: Pendrar-chan} is a {\i1}Harpoké{\i0} though, \N you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.77,0:20:51.94,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They’re kinda weird...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.20,0:21:03.24,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Today was a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.24,0:21:07.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There’s really all sorts of people \N and all sorts of Pokémon in the world, huh?{'all sorts' Navi repetition from 143}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.66,0:21:08.75,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,There sure are!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.30,0:21:18.26,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That sounds like a whole lotta fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.14,0:21:29.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh! Metamon’s all squishy while it’s awake, \N but it’s super hard when it falls asleep!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.27,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Can I see?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.85,0:21:34.23,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’re right!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.48,0:21:37.44,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I get it now!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.44,0:21:39.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Squishy and hard...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.49,0:21:42.45,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,...I {\i1}already{\i} loved \N both of ‘em!
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.58,0:21:48.29,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.29,0:21:51.79,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.38,0:21:55.59,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Namakobushi!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.59,0:21:58.17,Main,Friede,0,0,25,,A Pokémon that lives where the sea’s shallow, \N such as sandy beaches.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.17,0:22:02.55,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides{\i} their squishy bodies, \N do you know what other trait they’re known for?{Spinning, Swaying, Slimy}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.09,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.40,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.40,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,C: Being slimy!{This is the only episode with だ in the answer line - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.86,0:23:50.62,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Step on one by mistake and you’ll trip, \N and it might even get mad and punch you back.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.24,0:23:51.99,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.99,0:23:52.58,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.58,0:23:55.71,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.71,0:23:56.75,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.17,0:23:58.00,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Comment: 10,0:23:58.25,0:24:00.50,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhh!
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.25,0:24:04.01,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Today’s the fieldwork day \N we’ve been waiting for!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.59,0:24:06.09,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I’ll be with Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.09,0:24:07.80,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s Navi’s first time meeting him!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.80,0:24:09.68,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Heheh, can’t wait, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.68,0:24:11.89,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Hey! Long time, no see!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.43,0:24:13.97,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Friede!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.97,0:24:16.43,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wait, huh? \N Who’s that guy next to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.43,0:24:18.94,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Hey! Members of \N the Rising Voltteccers!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.94,0:24:19.90,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Uhh, umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.90,0:24:23.27,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.27,0:24:25.19,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The Expanding World, I’ll GO With You!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:25.19,0:24:27.32,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Now, everyone, GO with cheer!{092}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.32,0:24:29.82,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Hold on, \N at least introduce yourself!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
